    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typinc. is a roguelike deckbuilding typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete typing jobs presented to you to unlock perks which affects the score you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230090/extras/908c3d4a2aa5dd8d8fc3f63809f58bb7.poster.avif?t=1753865948\" width=414 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230090/extras/908c3d4a2aa5dd8d8fc3f63809f58bb7.webm?t=1753865948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230090/extras/908c3d4a2aa5dd8d8fc3f63809f58bb7.mp4?t=1753865948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Typing stats such as Best Typing Speed, Average of Last 10 and Accuracy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different perks for different effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
